{"input_path": "input/ipas中級_科目2_大數據處理分析與應用_imgs/page_0045.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 2382, "height": 3368, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "第三章 機率統計基礎", "block_bbox": [295, 208, 816, 260], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 208.0], [816.0, 208.0], [816.0, 260.0], [295.0, 260.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 對立假設（H $ _{1} $）依問題方向分為三種形式：", "block_bbox": [534, 401, 1551, 464], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 401.0], [1551.0, 401.0], [1551.0, 464.0], [534.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>檢定類型</td><td>對立假設  $ H_{{1}} $</td><td>適用情境</td></tr><tr><td>雙尾檢定</td><td>$ p \\neq p_{{0}} $</td><td>不確定方向，只想知道是否有差異</td></tr><tr><td>左尾檢定</td><td>$ p < p_{{0}} $</td><td>關注比例是否顯著低於預期（如滿意率是否未達標）</td></tr><tr><td>右尾檢定</td><td>$ p > p_{{0}} $</td><td>關注比例是否顯著高於預期（如通過率是否超標）</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [369, 496, 2072, 847], "block_id": 2, "block_order": null, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[369.0, 496.0], [2072.0, 496.0], [2072.0, 847.0], [369.0, 847.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "常見誤用與注意事項", "block_bbox": [475, 892, 1007, 952], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[475.0, 892.0], [1007.0, 892.0], [1007.0, 952.0], [475.0, 952.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 資料類型不符：此檢定僅適用於二元分類資料，不適用於多類別或順序型資料。", "block_bbox": [534, 995, 2079, 1152], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 995.0], [2079.0, 995.0], [2079.0, 1152.0], [534.0, 1152.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "樣本數不足時使用常態近似：若樣本太小或事件太少，使用常態近似會導致錯誤結果，應改用精確二項檢定。", "block_bbox": [536, 1192, 2080, 1356], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[536.0, 1192.0], [2080.0, 1192.0], [2080.0, 1356.0], [536.0, 1356.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "比例設定不合理：虛無假設中的  $ p_{0} $ 應有依據（例如：歷史數據、業界標準、法規等），不可任意設定。", "block_bbox": [519, 1393, 2080, 1554], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[519.0, 1393.0], [2080.0, 1393.0], [2080.0, 1554.0], [519.0, 1554.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "忽略實質差異與統計差異之別：即使結果具統計顯著性，實務上差異可能微小，仍需結合應用情境判斷其意義。", "block_bbox": [530, 1593, 2081, 1754], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[530.0, 1593.0], [2081.0, 1593.0], [2081.0, 1754.0], [530.0, 1754.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "• 雙樣本比例檢定（Two-sample proportion test）", "block_bbox": [402, 1793, 1472, 1854], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 1793.0], [1472.0, 1793.0], [1472.0, 1854.0], [402.0, 1854.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "◆ 方法概述", "block_bbox": [477, 1893, 754, 1956], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[477.0, 1893.0], [754.0, 1893.0], [754.0, 1956.0], [477.0, 1956.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 雙樣本比例檢定是用來比較兩個獨立樣本之間的事件發生比例是否存在顯著差異的方法。此檢定常應用於 A/B 測試、族群差異分析、政策效應評估等情境。", "block_bbox": [534, 1994, 2077, 2256], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 1994.0], [2077.0, 1994.0], [2077.0, 2256.0], [534.0, 2256.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "舉例來說，行銷團隊可透過此檢定比較兩種廣告版本的點擊率是否不同；或醫療研究中比較兩種藥物的治療成功率是否具有統計差異。", "block_bbox": [534, 2294, 2081, 2456], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2294.0], [2081.0, 2294.0], [2081.0, 2456.0], [534.0, 2456.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "適用條件與前提假設", "block_bbox": [477, 2495, 1007, 2554], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[477.0, 2495.0], [1007.0, 2495.0], [1007.0, 2554.0], [477.0, 2554.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "兩組樣本為獨立抽樣。", "block_bbox": [534, 2595, 1097, 2652], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2595.0], [1097.0, 2595.0], [1097.0, 2652.0], [534.0, 2652.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 資料屬於二元類別資料（如成功/失敗、有/無）。", "block_bbox": [534, 2695, 1654, 2754], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2695.0], [1654.0, 2695.0], [1654.0, 2754.0], [534.0, 2754.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 符合常態近似條件（ $ n \\times p \\geq 5 $ 且  $ n \\times (1 - p) \\geq 5 $）。", "block_bbox": [534, 2794, 1749, 2855], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2794.0], [1749.0, 2794.0], [1749.0, 2855.0], [534.0, 2855.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 若樣本數不足，應採用二項精確檢定（如 Fisher's exact test）。", "block_bbox": [534, 2894, 1949, 2955], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2894.0], [1949.0, 2894.0], [1949.0, 2955.0], [534.0, 2955.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "3-38", "block_bbox": [183, 3188, 282, 3232], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 3188.0], [282.0, 3188.0], [282.0, 3232.0], [183.0, 3232.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 12, "label": "header", "score": 0.8545830845832825, "coordinate": [295, 208, 816, 260], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[295.0, 208.0], [816.0, 208.0], [816.0, 260.0], [295.0, 260.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7146742343902588, "coordinate": [534, 401, 1551, 464], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 401.0], [1551.0, 401.0], [1551.0, 464.0], [534.0, 464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9644408226013184, "coordinate": [369, 496, 2072, 847], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[369.0, 496.0], [2072.0, 496.0], [2072.0, 847.0], [369.0, 847.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.32033079862594604, "coordinate": [748, 789, 896, 840], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[748.0, 789.0], [896.0, 789.0], [896.0, 840.0], [748.0, 840.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.46788421273231506, "coordinate": [475, 892, 1007, 952], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[475.0, 892.0], [1007.0, 892.0], [1007.0, 952.0], [475.0, 952.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9297263026237488, "coordinate": [534, 995, 2079, 1152], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 995.0], [2079.0, 995.0], [2079.0, 1152.0], [534.0, 1152.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9308556914329529, "coordinate": [536, 1192, 2080, 1356], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[536.0, 1192.0], [2080.0, 1192.0], [2080.0, 1356.0], [536.0, 1356.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9137197732925415, "coordinate": [519, 1393, 2080, 1554], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[519.0, 1393.0], [2080.0, 1393.0], [2080.0, 1554.0], [519.0, 1554.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.549267590045929, "coordinate": [1316, 1407, 1373, 1454], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[1316.0, 1407.0], [1373.0, 1407.0], [1373.0, 1454.0], [1316.0, 1454.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9124914407730103, "coordinate": [530, 1593, 2081, 1754], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[530.0, 1593.0], [2081.0, 1593.0], [2081.0, 1754.0], [530.0, 1754.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5282295942306519, "coordinate": [402, 1793, 1472, 1854], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[402.0, 1793.0], [1472.0, 1793.0], [1472.0, 1854.0], [402.0, 1854.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4958359897136688, "coordinate": [477, 1893, 754, 1956], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[477.0, 1893.0], [754.0, 1893.0], [754.0, 1956.0], [477.0, 1956.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9433379173278809, "coordinate": [534, 1994, 2077, 2256], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 1994.0], [2077.0, 1994.0], [2077.0, 2256.0], [534.0, 2256.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9289717078208923, "coordinate": [534, 2294, 2081, 2456], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2294.0], [2081.0, 2294.0], [2081.0, 2456.0], [534.0, 2456.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6111659407615662, "coordinate": [477, 2495, 1007, 2554], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[477.0, 2495.0], [1007.0, 2495.0], [1007.0, 2554.0], [477.0, 2554.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8547937273979187, "coordinate": [534, 2595, 1097, 2652], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2595.0], [1097.0, 2595.0], [1097.0, 2652.0], [534.0, 2652.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8693826794624329, "coordinate": [534, 2695, 1654, 2754], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2695.0], [1654.0, 2695.0], [1654.0, 2754.0], [534.0, 2754.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.862820029258728, "coordinate": [534, 2794, 1749, 2855], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2794.0], [1749.0, 2794.0], [1749.0, 2855.0], [534.0, 2855.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8695449829101562, "coordinate": [534, 2894, 1949, 2955], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2894.0], [1949.0, 2894.0], [1949.0, 2955.0], [534.0, 2955.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7688659429550171, "coordinate": [183, 3188, 282, 3232], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 3188.0], [282.0, 3188.0], [282.0, 3232.0], [183.0, 3232.0]]}]}}